## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverGuide
## Notes: Free, data-driven leveling guide engine for WoW Forever. Reads game state and shows you the next step. Never automates combat, movement or chat (quest accept / turn-in is optional).
## Author: RevoltLive
## Version: 0.3.10
## SavedVariables: ForeverGuideDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ForeverGuideCharDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Map_01
## X-Category: Quests & Leveling
## X-Flavor: Camelot (WoW Forever 1.60.x, Retail 12.x engine)

# ---- engine (load order matters) ----
Core.lua
Database.lua
